# LOF-1: the screensaver: a minute untouched, Red under the tree, nodding; a button only wakes it,
# a key wakes it and plays, a knob only wakes it, a MIDI-less wait brings it back
saver 60000
wait 30000
expect saver 0
wait 31000
expect saver 1
expect playing 1
shot saver.png
wait 200
shot saver_b.png
# PLAY wakes it and doesn't stop the music
tap PLAY
expect saver 0
expect playing 1
wait 300
shot after.png
# a minute more: back; a key wakes it and plays its note
wait 61000
expect saver 1
key 9 down
wait 300
key 9 up
expect saver 0
expect notes >0
# and a knob: wakes it, the tempo stays
wait 61000
expect saver 1
expect dirty 0
turn K1 1
expect saver 0
expect dirty 0
